Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:28.78,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}暴风雨来临前的宁静
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:31.89,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}It's me they all are coming for
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.78,0:20:31.89,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}他们蜂拥而至 对我发动袭击
