Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:38.66,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}そう まるで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:41.50,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}旬を過ぎチカラのように
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:44.51,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Rotten to the core deeper また一つ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:48.74,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}でも I have reawakened for revenge
